/* File:        04-process.demonstration.rxj
 * Description: This application demonstrates object-oriented process handling.
 * Shows:
 *              - Usage of basic message boxes with a specified title
 *              - Starting a process by dispatching "Start"
 *              - Sending keys to manipulate running applications
 *              - Starting a process with maximized window style and additional information
 *              - Retrieving the absolute path to temporary folder
 *
